<noinclude>
Form section for [[Template:PF2 stat block]], included by [[Template:Stats form]].
It saves into the page type's own template: Character, NPC or Creature.
Argument 1 is the page type, PC, NPC or Creature, and hides the rows that don't apply to it.
The form tags are in nowiki so Page Forms reads them after this page is transcluded.
</noinclude><includeonly><nowiki>{{{for template|PF2 stat block|multiple|embed in field=</nowiki>{{#switch:{{{1|}}}|PC=Character|#default={{{1|}}}}}<nowiki>[pf2]|label=PF2|add button text=Add PF2 stats|maximum instances=1}}}</nowiki>
{| class="formtable"
|-
